Batch chatgpt01 (22 frames, 2026-09-13) was checked the same way as gemini01:
top and bottom strips of every frame tiled and read at full width.

Result: no burned-in timestamp, no text overlay, no second venue, nothing
cinematic. Every top strip shows the identical barrier, fence and building,
which is the check that the camera never moved. All 22 recorded as
quality=synthetic:ok, and that value was assigned only after this check.

3 of the 22 are held unlabelled in data/interim/_pending_4d/ and are in
neither manifest.csv nor labels.csv.
